source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-23
observed: An effect's content may not begin with its own delimiter, so the outer `*` characters are literal and the inner pair renders bold.
-- input.jira --
**x**
-- rendered.html --
<p>*<b>x</b>*</p>
-- want.md --
\***x**\*
